@startuml
title Observer Lifecycle
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> ACTIVE : register
ACTIVE --> OUT_OF_RANGE : slant range > Rmax
OUT_OF_RANGE --> ACTIVE : slant range <= Rmax
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : observation time >= 3 h
ACTIVE --> EVICTED : 101st active registration
EXPIRED --> ARCHIVED
EVICTED --> ARCHIVED
ARCHIVED : immutable history retained
ARCHIVED --> [*]
@enduml
